lavender: the Gold clock steps down when the chip is hot: lv_therm_hi (85 C), lv_therm_lo (generator: xnu/src/mk_thermalguard.py)

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/LavenderMetrics.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/LavenderMetrics.cpp
